label all of the different buckets&nbsp;
with the sum that they represent.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:51.060
As we repeat this, we're looking at different&nbsp;
possible sums for those five random numbers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:57.180
And for those of you who are inclined to complain&nbsp;
that this is a highly unrealistic model for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:01.800
true Galton board, let me emphasize - the goal&nbsp;
right now is not to accurately model physics,&nbsp;&nbsp;

