the goal is to give a simple example to&nbsp;
illustrate the central limit theorem,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:10.140
and for that, idealized though this might be,&nbsp;
it actually gives us a really good example.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.940
If we let many different balls fall, making&nbsp;
yet another unrealistic assumption that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

