00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:20.280
highlight is how it's the variance that adds,&nbsp;
it's not the standard deviation that adds.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:23.940
So critically, if you were to take&nbsp;
'n' different realizations of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:28.980
